Z||000000||rogergarrison||11-02-2001||07:15 PM||||I know a few mentioned last week or so there were no women combat fighter pilots. I have a friend that is, and Dateline tonite at 9pm is interviewing some. Their dropping bombs in Afghanistan from F-14's and flying off Carriers. So heres a thumbs up for the ladies. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">||||reg||1
